WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.076 --> 00:00:06.182
Everything for the member Library lives under this one Library menu.

2
00:00:06.182 --> 00:00:09.142
To make a course, we go to Library, then Courses.

3
00:00:10.758 --> 00:00:12.208
Add New starts a blank course.

4
00:00:21.259 --> 00:00:24.450
The title and the excerpt are what members see on the course card.

5
00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:38.996
A few 'what you'll learn' outcomes and a Collection help members find and choose the course.

6
00:00:52.623 --> 00:00:54.437
This box tells us who can get in.

7
00:00:54.437 --> 00:00:57.349
We'll save a draft first so we can build the lessons.

8
00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:05.545
Lessons are grouped into sections, and sections live in the structure builder.

9
00:01:05.545 --> 00:01:08.204
Add a section, name it, and save the structure.

10
00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:23.783
Add lesson here opens a new lesson already placed in that section.

11
00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:27.382
Each lesson gets its video in the Media box — paste its link.

12
00:01:37.512 --> 00:01:40.890
Publish the lesson, and this link takes us straight back to the course.

13
00:01:48.827 --> 00:01:52.721
Publish the course. Within about a minute it shows up in the app on its own —

14
00:01:52.721 --> 00:01:53.884
we don't touch the app.
